Package: com.xsxs18.voidly
Name: Voidly
Version: 1.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Lightweight system cleaner for rootless and roothide jailbreaks.
 Removes caches, logs, temporary files and package leftovers, manages
 tweaks and launch daemons, finds large files and orphaned packages and
 can clean automatically on a schedule.
Maintainer: xsxs18
Author: xsxs18
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: com.xsxs18.purify
Replaces: com.xsxs18.purify
Provides: com.xsxs18.purify
Recommends: uikittools
